msgstr "Rang"

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/general.js:267
msgid ""
"Clients that support the attribute (e.g. Cisco Unity) use them to decide "
"which traffic is sent through the tunnel."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann cliaint a thacaíonn leis an tréith (m.sh. Cisco Unity) iad chun a "
"chinneadh cén trácht a sheoltar tríd an tollán."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/swanctl.js:731
