msgstr "Cumraigh paraiméadair sheirbhíse dhomhanda."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/strongswan.js:62
msgid "Configure how strongswan logs events, errors, and debug information."
msgstr ""
"Cumraigh an chaoi a ndéanann strongswan logáil ar imeachtaí, ar earráidí "
"agus ar fhaisnéis dhífhabhtaithe."

#: applications/luci-app-strongswan-swanctl/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/strongswan-swanctl/strongswan.js:123
